  "details": "The new profiles contain less information available at first glance, things are all over the place (e.g. pronouns next to Verified 18+ next to represented group), elements appear big. I believe in having more things at glance, no layout shift (things moving other things), better grouped information, less empty space - better effectiveness and readability in short. \n\nI put together my slightly reimagined version of the design in the attachment that might better convey what could be improved.\n\n2 screenshots - before and after",
